OL,3,ARussian ships hit by Ukrainian drones
OL,4,Aoff Libya coast, Zelensky says
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Russian warship was sunk by Ukrainian
OL,7,Fdrones off the coast of Libya on
OL,8,FSunday, President Volodymyr Zelensky
OL,9,Fsaid.
OL,11,FThe attack also hit a second Russian
OL,12,Fvessel, a cargo ship being used to
OL,13,Ftransport weapons, the Ukrainian prime
OL,14,Fminister claimed.
OL,16,FOn Sunday morning, the government that
OL,17,Fcontrols eastern Libya said there had
OL,18,Fbeen an explosion on the warship at the
OL,19,FBenghazi port, while it was docking for
OL,20,Ffuel and supplies ahead of its return
OL,21,Fto Russia.
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
